# CE source-upload ignore rules — rewritten by ./remote-bob --setup before each build.
# This file is a placeholder. The launcher generates the correct .ceignore for each
# build (apiserver or job-agent) immediately before the ibmcloud ce build upload.
# See the write_ceignore_apiserver() and write_ceignore_job_agent() functions in
# the remote-bob launcher script.
#
# Checked-in defaults (safe for both contexts):

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.template

# Runtime scratch and caches
tmp/
bobshell-*.tgz
*.log
.DS_Store
